1697
01:19:54,820 --> 01:19:58,000
Well, then, let's trust that my pendant will be returned to me.

1698
01:19:58,080 --> 01:20:01,200
And with hopeful spirits, let us now turn our focus to the task at hand.

1699
01:20:01,560 --> 01:20:03,100
We must not let the locals down.

1700
